<h1>@Localizer["Measure the requirement, not just the number"]</h1>
<p class="docs-lead">@Localizer["An inspection result depends on the feature definition, instrument, setup, environment, and decision rule. Agree these before production so a supplier and customer can reproduce the same check and understand a result close to a tolerance limit."]</p>
